    "type": "question",
    "label": "10",
    "prompt": "The crime rate in Gotham City has been rising each decade. In the last four decades the number of robberies has risen by 64%, 223%, 75% and 12%. If there are now 958 robberies per year, find how many robberies per year there were, correct to the nearest whole number:",
